{"text": "It was Jesus…", "start": 150.2, "end": 151.14, "words": [{"text": "It", "start": 150.2, "end": 150.28}, {"text": "was", "start": 150.32, "end": 150.52}, {"text": "Jesus…", "start": 150.62, "end": 151.14}]},
{"text": "God’s own Son.", "start": 151.74, "end": 152.78, "words": [{"text": "God’s", "start": 151.74, "end": 152.06}, {"text": "own", "start": 152.16, "end": 152.4}, {"text": "Son.", "start": 152.5, "end": 152.78}]},
{"text": "And He was with them in the boat the whole time.", "start": 153.34, "end": 155.66, "words": [{"text": "And", "start": 153.34, "end": 153.42}, {"text": "He", "start": 153.46, "end": 153.56}, {"text": "was", "start": 153.62, "end": 153.76}, {"text": "with", "start": 153.82, "end": 153.98}, {"text": "them", "start": 154.04, "end": 154.14}, {"text": "in", "start": 154.2, "end": 154.26}, {"text": "the", "start": 154.3, "end": 154.4}, {"text": "boat", "start": 154.46, "end": 154.68}, {"text": "the", "start": 154.74, "end": 154.84}, {"text": "whole", "start": 154.92, "end": 155.18}, {"text": "time.", "start": 155.26, "end": 155.66}]},
{"text": "You know, little one…", "start": 158.14, "end": 159.3, "words": [{"text": "You", "start": 158.14, "end": 158.2}, {"text": "know,", "start": 158.28, "end": 158.5}, {"text": "little", "start": 158.76, "end": 159}, {"text": "one…", "start": 159.1, "end": 159.3}]},
